#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:15
msgid "SECURITY"
msgstr "보안"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Language:** *Language class DoS Vulnerability* was fixed. See the "
"`Security advisory GHSA-39fp-mqmm-gxj6 "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"39fp-mqmm-gxj6>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""
"**언어:** *Language 클래스 DoS 취약점*\ 이 수정되었습니다. 자세한 내용은 "
"`보안 권고 GHSA-39fp-mqmm-gxj6 "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"39fp-mqmm-gxj6>`_\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"**URI Security:** The feature to check if URIs do not contain not "
"permitted strings has been added. This check is equivalent to the URI "
"Security found in CodeIgniter 3. This is enabled by default, but upgraded"
" users need to add a setting to enable it. See :ref:`urls-uri-security` "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"**URI 보안:** URI에 허용되지 않는 문자열이 포함되지 않았는지 확인하는 기능이 추가되었습니다. "
"이 확인은 CodeIgniter 3에서 발견된 URI 보안과 동일합니다. "
"기본적으로 활성화되어 있지만, 업그레이드한 사용자는 활성화하기 위해 설정을 추가해야 합니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`urls-uri-security`\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Filters:** A bug where URI paths processed by Filters were not URL-"
"decoded has been fixed. See :ref:`upgrade-447-filter-paths` for details."
msgstr ""
"**필터:** 필터에서 처리하는 URI 경로가 URL 디코딩되지 않던 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`upgrade-447-filter-paths`\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:29
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:31
msgid ""
"In previous versions, when comparing dates with ``Time::difference()``, "
"unexpected results were returned if the date included a day different "
"from 24 hours due to Daylight Saving Time (DST). This bug has been fixed."
" See :ref:`Note in Times and Dates <time-viewing-differences>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"이전 버전에서 ``Time::difference()``\ 로 날짜를 비교할 때 일광 절약 시간(DST)으로 인해 "
"24시간이 아닌 날이 포함된 경우 예상치 못한 결과가 반환되었습니다. 이 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`Times and Dates 참고사항 <time-viewing-differences>`\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.7.rst:38
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

